/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Organic\040synthesis\040in\040a\040modular\040robotic\040system\040driven\040by\040a\040chemical\040programming\040language)
/Author (Sebastian\040Steiner\054\040Jakob\040Wolf\054\040Stefan\040Glatzel\054\040Anna\040Andreou\054\040Jaros\233aw\040M\056\040Granda\054\040Graham\040Keenan\054\040Trevor\040Hinkley\054\040Gerardo\040Aragon\055Camarasa\054\040Philip\040J\056\040Kitson\054\040Davide\040Angelone\054\040Leroy\040Cronin)
/Subject (The\040synthesis\040of\040complex\040organic\040compounds\040is\040largely\040a\040manual\040process\040that\040is\040often\040incompletely\040documented\056\040To\040address\040these\040shortcomings\054\040we\040developed\040an\040abstraction\040that\040maps\040commonly\040reported\040methodological\040instructions\040into\040discrete\040steps\040amenable\040to\040automation\056\040These\040unit\040operations\040were\040implemented\040in\040a\040modular\040robotic\040platform\040using\040a\040chemical\040programming\040language\040which\040formalizes\040and\040controls\040the\040assembly\040of\040the\040molecules\056\040We\040validated\040the\040concept\040by\040directing\040the\040automated\040system\040to\040synthesize\040three\040pharmaceutical\040compounds\054\040Nytol\054\040rufinamide\054\040and\040sildenafil\054\040without\040any\040human\040intervention\056\040Yields\040and\040purities\040of\040products\040and\040intermediates\040were\040comparable\040to\040or\040better\040than\040those\040achieved\040manually\056\040The\040syntheses\040are\040captured\040as\040digital\040code\040that\040can\040be\040published\054\040versioned\054\040and\040transferred\040flexibly\040between\040platforms\040with\040no\040modification\054\040thereby\040greatly\040enhancing\040reproducibility\040and\040reliable\040access\040to\040complex\040molecules\056)
/Keywords (11\040Jan\0402019\054\040Science\054\040Modular\040design\054\040University\040of\040Glasgow)
>>
